  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Programme Insourced Role to support the Durable Solutions Adviser with in-country engagement with key Iraqi interlocutors</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">the Durable Solutions Advisor sits within the Resident Coordinator&apos;s office at the UN and provides a cohering function across all UN agencies in Iraq working on the returns/reintegration/durable solutions file. This includes IDPs returning to areas of origin/return; Iraqi nationals returning from North East Syria camps; and understanding the status of Iraqis who may not have access to their full rights.</narrative>
  </description>
